---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="Privacy Policy | Growpha"
			description="How Growpha collects, uses and protects the personal details you share through its audit request, contact and newsletter forms."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="pp-section">
				<div class="gp-container pp-container">
					<div class="svc-breadcrumb">
						<a href="/">Home</a>
						<span>›</span>
						<span>Privacy Policy</span>
					</div>
					<h1 class="pp-h1">Privacy Policy</h1>
					<p class="pp-updated">Last updated: 2 November 2026</p>

					<p>
						This policy explains what personal information Growpha collects through growpha.com, why we collect
						it, and what you can ask us to do with it. Growpha is a Dubai-based SEO and digital growth consultancy
						run by Fadil İleri.
					</p>

					<h2>What we collect</h2>
					<p>We collect only what you choose to send us through the forms on this site, or by messaging us directly.</p>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Audit request form:</strong> your name, email address, website URL, company name (optional), WhatsApp or phone number (optional) and the message you write.</li>
						<li><strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email address and message.</li>
						<li><strong>Newsletter sign-up:</strong> your email address.</li>
						<li><strong>WhatsApp or email:</strong> anything you send us, including your phone number.</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						We do not run analytics or advertising trackers on this site. Our hosting provider may keep standard
						server logs (such as IP address, browser type and the pages requested) to keep the site secure and
						working. Some logos on our service pages are loaded from an external image service (cdn.simpleicons.org),
						which receives your IP address and browser details when the page loads.
					</p>

					<h2>How we use it</h2>
					<ul>
						<li>To reply to your request and to carry out the work you ask for, including delivering an SEO audit.</li>
						<li>To send you the newsletter, if you subscribed to it. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
						<li>To keep a record of our correspondence and our business records.</li>
						<li>To protect the site from spam and abuse.</li>
					</ul>
					<p>We do not sell your personal information and we do not use it for advertising.</p>

					<h2>Why we are allowed to use it</h2>
					<p>
						We use your details because you asked us to contact you or to provide a service, because you agreed
						to receive our newsletter, and because we have a legitimate interest in running and securing the
						business. We handle personal data in line with the UAE's personal data protection law (Federal
						Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021).
					</p>

					<h2>Who we share it with</h2>
					<p>
						We share personal information only with the service providers that help us run the site and respond to
						you: Netlify, which hosts the website and processes form submissions, and the email service we use to
						receive form notifications and reply to you. These providers may process data outside the UAE. We
						will disclose information where the law requires it.
					</p>

					<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
					<p>
						We keep your details for as long as we need them to deal with your request and to maintain our business
						records. We delete them on request unless we are required to keep them by law.
					</p>

					<h2>Your rights</h2>
					<p>You can ask us to:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>tell you what personal information we hold about you;</li>
						<li>correct information that is wrong;</li>
						<li>delete your information;</li>
						<li>stop using your information for a purpose you object to, or withdraw consent you gave us.</li>
					</ul>
					<p>To make a request, <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> or message us on WhatsApp at <a href="https://wa.me/971522418594" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">+971 52 241 8594</a>. We will reply within a reasonable time.</p>

					<h2>Security</h2>
					<p>
						The site is served over HTTPS and form submissions are handled by our hosting provider. No online
						service is completely secure, so please do not send us passwords or payment card details through the
						forms. Audit access is always read-only.
					</p>

					<h2>Children</h2>
					<p>This site is for businesses. It is not directed at children and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

					<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
					<p>If we change this policy, we will update the date at the top of this page.</p>

					<h2>Contact</h2>
					<p>
						Questions about this policy? Use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> or message us on <a href="https://wa.me/971522418594" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a>.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	main {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
	}
	.pp-section {
		background: var(--growpha-black);
		padding: 72px 0 96px;
	}
	.pp-container {
		max-width: 760px;
	}
	.svc-breadcrumb {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 12px;
		margin-bottom: 24px;
		font-size: 0.8125rem;
		color: var(--growpha-text-muted);
	}
	.svc-breadcrumb a {
		color: var(--growpha-text-muted);
	}
	.pp-h1 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
		line-height: 1.1;
		color: var(--growpha-text-primary);
		margin: 0 0 8px;
	}
	.pp-updated {
		color: var(--growpha-text-muted);
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		margin: 0 0 32px;
	}
	.pp-section h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 1.375rem;
		color: var(--growpha-text-primary);
		margin: 40px 0 12px;
	}
	.pp-section p,
	.pp-section li {
		color: var(--growpha-text-secondary);
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}
	.pp-section p {
		margin: 0 0 16px;
	}
	.pp-section ul {
		margin: 0 0 16px;
		padding-left: 22px;
	}
	.pp-section li {
		margin-bottom: 8px;
	}
	.pp-section strong {
		color: var(--growpha-text-primary);
	}
	.pp-section a {
		color: var(--growpha-green-bright);
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
	}
	.pp-section a:hover {
		color: var(--growpha-orange);
	}
</style>
